:0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"质量改进工程师(J12370)","OrgId":655601,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.开展所辖管生产工厂的现场质量控制工作，负责生产过程质量控制工作的推动、督导与执行：\n2.运用科学有效的统计分析和质量控制方法，收集生产过程质量数据，掌握现场各工序各产品的质量控制水平与主要问题；\n3.坚持按二八原则，持续改善现场质量异常问题，提升现场质量控制能力；\n4.及时处理现场品质异常或潜在异常，提出品质改善建议并追踪落实；\n5.掌握生产许可办理、HACCP、ISO22000、FSSC22000等质量体系的搭建和审核办理；\n6.有薯片/烘焙类车间品质管控经验优先。","Require":"1. 同岗位2年以上工作经验；\n2. 本科及以上学历。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-15T08:58:39","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"7cf6bbe7-3ad7-4dd0-b843-d7864ac69399","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270989994,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"品控员(J11802)","OrgId":2150209,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.依据不同产品加工工艺流程与质量控制标准、卫生控制规范和生产过程检验规范进行各个品检项目的质量巡查、监控、记录、抽检工作；\n2.发现异常或潜在异常，及时控制并上报，运用质量工具进行分析，协助现场改善；\n3.跟踪车间落实相关品质改善措施并验证效果；\n4.车问微生物涂抹沉降、计量校准、虫害