悉政府安监、环保检查流程。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-15T08:53:11","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"35dd5578-ccf6-447a-9f9a-35bc0db31953","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270989992,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"班长(J11816)","OrgId":2150211,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.岗位操作标准的落地及监督执行；\n2.生产各工序作业流程的执行落地；\n3.员工培训及考核、团队建设与培养；\n4.现场5S实施及管理和车间虫鼠防控；\n5.生产成本管控（水、电、汽/天然气等）；\n6.生产计划的执行和生产物料收、发异常的追踪。\n7.年、月、日生产量的报表的统计分析和生产效率的提升及改进方案。","Require":"1.年龄25--35岁，其他条件优秀者可适当放宽；\n2、专科以上学历（电气、机械、食品等专业优先），至少3年以上焙烤、油炸、辣卤、魔芋、饮料等食品生产现场同等岗位管理相关工作经验；\n3、要求工作积极耐心，有良好的沟通协调能力，团队合作精神以及较强的责任心以及抗压性。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel